          {
            "text": "I woke up on the last train. No sketchbook. The white thing was asleep on the seat next to me.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7.8
          },
          {
            "text": "I'd drawn it. In the margins, in 1998, maybe '99. I don't know how I forgot.",
            "start": 8.28,
            "end": 14.14
          },
          {
            "text": "I bought a pen at the kiosk on the way out. That's it. That's the story.",
            "start": 14.71,
            "end": 19.45
          }
        ]
      },
